* Provenance: derived for circsim from manufacturer datasheet operating points by scripts/fit-model-cards.mjs, MIT.
* In-house bipolar-transistor .model cards (ngspice Gummel-Poon NPN/PNP).
*
* The cards below are the output of scripts/fit-model-cards.mjs. Its inputs are
* datasheet figures only: hFE at stated collector currents (window midpoint at
* the reference current, scaled to two other currents by the guaranteed minima),
* Vbe at the reference current, output conductance hoe (-> vaf), fT (-> tf),
* Cobo and Cibo at their stated bias (-> cjc, cje) and the storage time ts
* (-> tr, calibrated once against a simulated ngspice 46 turn-off so the card
* reproduces the stated ts). Nothing is read from any third-party library card, and
* src/core/models/__tests__/library-fingerprint.test.ts fails CI if a bundled
* card's parameter tuple matches a known PSpice or LTspice library card.
*
* Values that are NOT datasheet figures (device-class assumptions): br=3,
* var=20, ne=1.5, xtb=1.5, eg=1.11, vje/vjc=0.75 and mje/mjc=0.33 (ngspice
* defaults, no C-V curve sampled), re=0.3, rb=10 (2N2222A: from the stated
* rb x Cc product), rc (half the slope of the two stated VCE(sat) maxima),
* Cobo and Cibo typical taken as 0.75 x the datasheet maximum where only a
* maximum is stated. The figures themselves are transcribed from the datasheet
* families and are not yet re-verified against vendor PDFs row by row.
*
* Checked against the datasheet points in resources/models/characterization.json
* (hFE, Vce(sat)); run `npm run test:characterization`.
*
* Glossary: is=sat current, bf=fwd beta, vaf=Early V, ikf=knee, rb/rc/re=
* ohmic, cje/cjc=junction caps, tf/tr=transit times.

* --------------------------------------------------------------------------- NPN
* 2N2222A NPN switching/amplifier (hFE 100-300 at 150mA/10V, fT>=300MHz, Ic=800mA).
* Inputs: hFE 141/200/126 at 0.1mA/150mA/500mA (Vce=10V), Vbe 0.9V at 150mA,
* hoe 20umho (1mA,10V), fT 300MHz (20mA,20V), Cobo 8pF max (10V), Cibo 25pF
* max (0.5V), ts 225ns (150mA, IB1=IB2=15mA), rb'Cc 150ps.
.model Q2N2222 NPN(is=1.6f bf=253 vaf=40 ikf=0.335 ise=27.3f ne=1.5 br=3
+ var=20 rb=25 rc=1 re=0.3 cje=22.2p vje=0.75 mje=0.33 tf=469p cjc=14.4p
+ vjc=0.75 mjc=0.33 tr=112n xtb=1.5 eg=1.11)

* 2N3904 NPN general purpose (hFE 100-300 at 10mA/1V, fT>=300MHz, Ic=200mA).
* Inputs: hFE 126/200/110 at 0.1mA/10mA/100mA (Vce=1V), Vbe 0.75V at 10mA,
* hoe 20.5umho (1mA,10V), fT 300MHz (10mA,20V), Cobo 4pF max (5V), Cibo 8pF
* max (0.5V), ts 200ns (10mA, IB1=IB2=1mA).
.model Q2N3904 NPN(is=3.43f bf=298 vaf=38.8 ikf=75.5m ise=46.8f ne=1.5 br=3
+ var=20 rb=10 rc=1.2 re=0.3 cje=7.1p vje=0.75 mje=0.33 tf=492p cjc=5.88p
+ vjc=0.75 mjc=0.33 tr=97.6n xtb=1.5 eg=1.11)

* BC547B NPN general purpose (hFE 200-450, typical 290 at 2mA/5V, fT=300MHz).
* Inputs: hFE 150/290/180 at 10uA/2mA/100mA (Vce=5V), Vbe 0.66V at 2mA,
* hoe 30umho (2mA,5V), fT 300MHz (10mA,5V), Cc 1.5pF typ (10V), Ce 11pF typ
* (0.5V), ts 280ns typ (10mA, IB1=IB2=0.5mA).
.model QBC547 NPN(is=16.7f bf=356 vaf=61.7 ikf=0.104 ise=57.8f ne=1.5 br=3
+ var=20 rb=10 rc=1 re=0.3 cje=13p vje=0.75 mje=0.33 tf=469p cjc=3.61p
+ vjc=0.75 mjc=0.33 tr=149n xtb=1.5 eg=1.11)

* --------------------------------------------------------------------------- PNP
* 2N3906 PNP general purpose (hFE 100-300 at 10mA/1V, fT>=250MHz, Ic=200mA).
* Inputs: hFE 155/200/110 at 0.1mA/10mA/100mA (Vce=1V), Vbe 0.75V at 10mA,
* hoe 20.5umho (1mA,10V), fT 250MHz (10mA,20V), Cobo 4.5pF max (5V), Cibo
* 10pF max (0.5V), ts 225ns (10mA, IB1=IB2=1mA).
.model Q2N3906 PNP(is=3.37f bf=262 vaf=38.8 ikf=87.8m ise=26.1f ne=1.5 br=3
+ var=20 rb=10 rc=1.9 re=0.3 cje=8.88p vje=0.75 mje=0.33 tf=588p cjc=6.61p
+ vjc=0.75 mjc=0.33 tr=112n xtb=1.5 eg=1.11)

* BC557B PNP general purpose (hFE 200-450, typical 290 at 2mA/5V, fT=150MHz).
* Inputs: hFE 100/290/140 at 10uA/2mA/100mA (Vce=5V), Vbe 0.65V at 2mA,
* hoe 30umho (2mA,5V), fT 150MHz (10mA,5V), Cc 4.5pF typ (10V), Ce 11pF typ
* (0.5V), ts 300ns typ (10mA, IB1=IB2=0.5mA).
.model QBC557 PNP(is=25.2f bf=499 vaf=61.7 ikf=43.3m ise=154f ne=1.5 br=3
+ var=20 rb=10 rc=1.5 re=0.3 cje=13p vje=0.75 mje=0.33 tf=983p cjc=10.8p
+ vjc=0.75 mjc=0.33 tr=160n xtb=1.5 eg=1.11)
